Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: that after the disclosure of the millions of pesos of missing funds for the PDL Trust Fund,

3354
03:33:19,460 --> 03:33:23,760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: the PDLs have been having a hard time withdrawing or accessing the money.

3355
03:33:23,800 --> 03:33:29,200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: In their accounts, before, like what the distinguished sponsor said,

3356
03:33:30,040 --> 03:33:32,660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: the PDLs were allowed to withdraw three times a week

3357
03:33:32,660 --> 03:33:37,640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: with a maximum of 1,000 pesos per withdrawal

3358
03:33:37,640 --> 03:33:41,780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: and a total allowable weekly withdrawal of 2,000 pesos.

3359
03:33:43,180 --> 03:33:51,020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: In recent experiences po, they said that these withdrawals have become erratic and irregular, yung policies.

3360
03:33:51,020 --> 03:33:53,780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So naayos na po ba ito sa ngayon?

3361
03:33:53,800 --> 03:33:56,960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At nakarating po ba sa office ng ating Director General?

3362
03:33:59,240 --> 03:34:03,720
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Nakarating na po yung mga gantong reports sa ating Bureau of Corrections.

3363
03:34:04,420 --> 03:34:10,260
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: They're inaayos na po nila yung ganitong mga sistema

3364
03:34:10,260 --> 03:34:16,740
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: at pinapabalik na po sa normal na withdrawal po yung ating mga PDLs.

3365
03:34:17,880 --> 03:34:21,880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maasahan po ba natin, Madam Speaker, na sa linggong ito, maaayos na po

3366
03:34:21,880 --> 03:34:23,780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung sistema na ito ng withdrawal?

3367
03:34:23,800 --> 03:34:25,380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Bababalik doon sa dati?

3368
03:34:25,840 --> 03:34:35,820
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yes po. The Bureau of Corrections are guaranteeing that they will go back to the standard system po ng ating withdrawal.

3369
03:34:37,240 --> 03:34:41,700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Magandang balita po na bababalik na yung dating sistema ng withdrawal.

3370
03:34:41,920 --> 03:34:48,120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero mas magandang balita po sana kung magkakaroon na ng update tungkol naman doon sa restoration

3371
03:34:48,120 --> 03:34:52,200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng nawawala na pera sa PDL Trust Fund.

3372
03:34:52,200 --> 03:34:53,780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron na po ba kayong petsa

3373
03:34:53,800 --> 03:34:57,160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kung kailan ito matitiyak na maibabalik?

3374
03:34:57,440 --> 03:35:28,120
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Madam Speaker, distinguished colleague, may update po ngayong araw. As we are informed, meron pong confiscated na pera ang BuCor, about 6 million in confiscated money na pinag-aaralan po nila na baka po pwedeng iyon yung gamitin to revert.

3375
03:35:29,120 --> 03:35:34,120
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Kung yun po yung pwedeng gamitin na maipangbayad sa mga nawawalan po ng amount

3376
03:35:34,120 --> 03:35:38,020
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: kasi wala pong nagkiklaim nung confiscated money na yun.

3377
03:35:38,280 --> 03:35:44,620
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: So sa ngayon po, undergoing legal study po yung paggamit po nung pera ngayon.

3378
03:35:47,100 --> 03:35:49,360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dapat talaga maimbestigahan po yan, Madam Speaker,

3379
03:35:49,360 --> 03:35:52,560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kasi nakakahinala naman po na may biglang sumulpot na ganyan.

3380
03:35:52,840 --> 03:35:53,360
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa panahon na...

3381
03:35:53,800 --> 03:36:00,600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Napaka-init po ng issue na ito na nananawagan po tayo ng patas na investigasyon,

3382
03:36:00,600 --> 03:36:07,320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng malinaw na sistema at may malinaw na mananagot kapag may ganitong tipo ng mga issue.

3383
03:36:07,880 --> 03:36:15,080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Chair, nanggaling din po sa ating plenary deliberations ang Commission on Human Rights

3384
03:36:15,080 --> 03:36:22,680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at nagbigay po sila ng update tungkol dito sa nawawalang pondo sa Trust Fund sa CIW.

3385
03:36:22,680 --> 03:36:23,780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At sinabi po nila,

3386
03:36:23,800 --> 03:36:33,800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na ilang beses daw po sila na nagtangka po at nagplano na bumisita sa CIW

3387
03:36:34,320 --> 03:36:38,160
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para mag-conduct ng kanilang independent investigation.

3388
03:36:38,560 --> 03:36:42,800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngunit ang kanila pong ulat ay hindi po sila pinapapasok sa CIW.

3389
03:36:43,480 --> 03:36:47,280
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maari bang magbigay ng paglilinaw ang ating distinguished sponsor tungkol dito?

3390
03:36:53,800 --> 03:37:19,860
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Madam Speaker, as per sa ating Bureau of Corrections,

3391
03:37:19,860 --> 03:37:23,780
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: may coordination naman po with CIW and the Commission on Human Rights.

3392
03:37:23,800 --> 03:37:28,400
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Regarding this matter, kung nagkaproblema man daw po,

3393
03:37:28,980 --> 03:37:37,880
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: ang malaking factor po daw ay yung pagdating kung kailan po dumating ang ating mga kawanimula po

3394
03:37:37,880 --> 03:37:41,220
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: galing sa Commission on Human Rights. Madam Speaker.

3395
03:37:42,800 --> 03:37:45,900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pwede ba natin malaman Madam Speaker kung ano po yung problema na yun?

3396
03:37:46,840 --> 03:37:53,780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi po ba pag may visitation ng CHR para mag-imbestiga tungkol sa mga potensyal na,

3397
03:37:53,800 --> 03:37:59,880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: paglabag sa karapatang pantao, at anytime, na dapat po payagan po sila na makapasok?

3398
03:38:03,680 --> 03:38:12,060
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: As per our Bureau of Corrections, bandang hapon daw po dumating ang ating mga taga-CHR.

3399
03:38:13,940 --> 03:38:17,800
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Meron pong oras na sinusunod yung ating mga PDLs.

3400
03:38:18,800 --> 03:38:23,780
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: So kaya daw po, hindi po muna pinapasok ang ating mga ka-PDLs.

3401
03:38:23,800 --> 03:38:27,200
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Ang kawanimula po sa Commission on Human Rights.

3402
03:38:27,560 --> 03:38:35,900
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Pero ang ating pong Bureau of Corrections are willing na makipagtulungan po sa ating pong CHR.

3403
03:38:36,440 --> 03:38:40,860
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Ayaw naman po nilang i-undermine yung kapangyarihan ng ating pong Commission on Human Rights.

3404
03:38:42,360 --> 03:38:50,320
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Lalo na po doon sa unannounced visits sa ating pong mga penal farms.

3405
03:38:50,320 --> 03:38:53,320
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: So ang request lang,

3406
03:38:53,800 --> 03:38:56,880
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: ang request lang rin po ng Bureau of Corrections, lalo na ay yung,

3407
03:38:58,760 --> 03:39:00,440
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: siguro may mga safeguards rin po.

3408
03:39:01,440 --> 03:39:06,700
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Siyempre may security concern rin po silang,

3409
03:39:07,620 --> 03:39:09,260
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: gustong masunod rin po.

3410
03:39:09,920 --> 03:39:11,320
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Madam Speaker, disengish ko ulit.

3411
03:39:12,280 --> 03:39:17,320
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker, may kopya po tayo ng sulat ng Bucor para po sa CHR.

3412
03:39:17,880 --> 03:39:23,780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Tungkol sa request ng CHR para sa dialogue sa mga PDLs sa CIW.

3413
03:39:23,800 --> 03:39:27,480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At may sinasabi po dito ang Bucor na,

3414
03:39:29,340 --> 03:39:31,980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: and let me just read this for the record.

3415
03:39:33,520 --> 03:39:37,660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Considering Data Privacy Act and based from the 2024 Bucor Manual,

3416
03:39:38,220 --> 03:39:46,260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: there is a need for the requesting party to identify specifically the name, names of PDL subject for a dialogue interview

3417
03:39:46,260 --> 03:39:50,920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: for us to secure the consent from the identified PDL.

3418
03:39:50,920 --> 03:39:53,340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May we know the particular provision?

3419
03:39:53,800 --> 03:39:59,140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: In the Data Privacy Act as well as the 2024 Bucor Manual,

3420
03:39:59,500 --> 03:40:04,380
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: which formed the basis of this particular statement?

3421
03:40:45,070 --> 03:40:48,280
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: So ang protocol daw po sa ating Bureau of Corrections is

3422
03:40:48,280 --> 03:40:58,320
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: kailangan po magpaalam po sa ating PDL kung gusto rin po nilang makipag-usap sa ating mga ibat-ibang gusto mag-interview po sa kanila.

3423
03:40:59,640 --> 03:41:02,280
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Pero as for kung meron pong...

3424
03:41:10,280 --> 03:41:16,280
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: As for yung visitation manual po nila for PDLs,

3425
03:41:16,480 --> 03:41:18,280
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: meron po kasing sinusunod na...

3426
03:41:18,280 --> 03:41:26,260
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: oras sa kanilang manual Wednesday to Sunday, 7 a.m. to 3 p.m. daw po

3427
03:41:26,260 --> 03:41:31,700
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: ang ating pong visiting hours according to the Bureau of Corrections manual po.

3428
03:41:33,240 --> 03:41:37,020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Tama po ba yung rinig ko kailangan pong magpaalam ng CHR sa Bucor

3429
03:41:37,020 --> 03:41:41,950
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para gawin yung kanilang constitutional duty?

3430
03:41:41,950 --> 03:41:43,880
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Ah, hindi naman po kailangang

3431
03:41:44,880 --> 03:41:46,880
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: magpaalam po ang

3432
03:41:48,280 --> 03:41:52,500
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Commission on Human Rights to investigate, Madam Speaker.

3433
03:41:53,280 --> 03:41:57,280
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Ang close coordination lang po with the Bucor is enough

3434
03:41:57,280 --> 03:42:00,720
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: because may mga security concerns nga po.

3435
03:42:01,300 --> 03:42:06,200
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: May instance nga daw po kasi na may mga po mapasok nagpapanggap.

3436
03:42:06,560 --> 03:42:10,680
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yun po yung nabanggit po ng ating pong Director General, Madam Speaker.

3437
03:42:11,820 --> 03:42:14,540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat sa paglilinaw, Madam Speaker.

3438
03:42:15,380 --> 03:42:17,400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At sana po hindi na maulit ito.

3439
03:42:17,400 --> 03:42:18,120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kasi hindi lang...

3440
03:42:18,120 --> 03:42:22,940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi lang daw po isang beses na sumubok na magbisita ang CHR,

3441
03:42:23,040 --> 03:42:24,240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kundi po tatlong beses.

3442
03:42:24,440 --> 03:42:27,740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya sana po magkaroon ng mas mahigpit na coordination

3443
03:42:27,740 --> 03:42:32,100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para lamang po dun sa interest ng katotohanan

3444
03:42:32,100 --> 03:42:39,820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at sa interest ng pananagutan pagdating po sa napakahalaga na matter na ito.

3445
03:42:39,920 --> 03:42:40,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman, Madam Speaker,

3446
03:42:41,040 --> 03:42:43,920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pwede ba natin kunin yung commitment ng Bucor

3447
03:42:43,920 --> 03:42:47,920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: dahil po sa marami pang hindi nasusunod na mga...

3448
03:42:48,120 --> 03:42:51,260
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dapat, no, katulad sa reporting, monitoring,

3449
03:42:52,080 --> 03:42:56,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: may nakita tayong mga gaps pa sa mga proseso kung paano natin matipiyak

3450
03:42:56,860 --> 03:43:02,500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng sistema na ito ay hindi po makukorup, hindi mawawala.

3451
03:43:03,180 --> 03:43:09,500
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pwede bang ma-review natin itong sistema, itong guidelines na ito tungkol sa cashless system?

3452
03:43:09,900 --> 03:43:14,220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Bukod dyan, Madam Speaker, maaari din na sa lalong madaling panahon.

3453
03:43:15,120 --> 03:43:18,080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sinabi nyo nga po may development sa CIW.

3454
03:43:18,120 --> 03:43:20,840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ay ma-restore na dun sa dating sistema muna

3455
03:43:20,840 --> 03:43:27,080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: habang nag-iimbestiga kayo at habang nire-review ninyo itong cashless system.

3456
03:43:27,080 --> 03:43:33,020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang kinababahala ng representasyon na ito, Madam Speaker, sa CIW pa lang ito.

3457
03:43:33,220 --> 03:43:38,740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So paano po, sana naman po hindi na hindi dapat ito nangyayari

3458
03:43:38,740 --> 03:43:41,600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa kahit saan nating prison and penal terms.

3459
03:43:43,040 --> 03:43:47,400
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: So they are committed to reviewing the policy on the cashless system po.

3460
03:43:48,120 --> 03:43:55,220
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Any suggestions or comments regarding that system are welcome po sa ating Bureau of Corrections

3461
03:43:55,220 --> 03:44:01,720
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: and they are committed na hindi na po maulit yung ganitong insidente with the Commission on Human Rights.

3462
03:44:01,940 --> 03:44:07,080
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Basta ang request nga lang po, basta regarding security concern, ma-address po nilang dalawa.

3463
03:44:07,680 --> 03:44:10,680
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Close coordination with the Commission on Human Rights.

3464
03:44:10,680 --> 03:44:17,600
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: And nagpa-audit na rin po ang ating Bureau of Corrections regarding,

3465
03:44:18,120 --> 03:44:24,080
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: kung may ganitong incident sa other penal firms para po maiwasan na yung ganitong mga klaseng insidente.

3466
03:44:24,520 --> 03:44:32,180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Madam Speaker, at ating aabangan yung risulta ng internal audit service na yan.

3467
03:44:32,560 --> 03:44:37,980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman po, at tungkol naman po sa ibang mahalaga din na usapin,

3468
03:44:38,080 --> 03:44:41,640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: tungkol po sa legal assistance para sa child support cases.

3469
03:44:42,980 --> 03:44:45,880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kung maari po nating matanong ang Public Attorney's Office,

3470
03:44:46,600 --> 03:44:48,100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: how many cases for child support?

3471
03:44:48,120 --> 03:44:50,020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: What is PAO currently handling?

3472
03:45:00,000 --> 03:45:12,420
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: As of now po, Madam Speaker, there is no data regarding child support cases pero parang sa VAUSI po talaga yung kanilang data.

3473
03:45:13,480 --> 03:45:14,620
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Maraming salamat Madam Speaker.

3474
03:45:14,620 --> 03:45:15,560
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Hindi po siya broken down.

3475
03:45:16,360 --> 03:45:26,060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pahingin na lang po natin yung ulat kapag nagawa na po ito ng PAO dahil kami rin po ay nagsulunsad ngayon ng Pambansang Review ng Anti-Violence Against Women and Their Children.

3476
03:45:26,060 --> 03:45:37,720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At marami po sa mga usapin ng mga nagiging biktima, survivors natin ay may kinalaman sa child support, kasama na ang spousal support.

3477
03:45:38,400 --> 03:45:49,940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya nais ko rin pong magtanong, dahil ang Pilipinas po ay nag-gratify ng Convention on the International Recovery of Child Support and Other Forms of Family Maintenance,

3478
03:45:50,280 --> 03:45:55,940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: meron din po bang nahahawakan ng mga kaso ang PAO na may kinalaman sa demand for child support?

3479
03:45:56,060 --> 03:46:02,460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At family maintenance mula po sa mga Pilipinos na nagtatrabaho at nakatira overseas?

3480
03:46:05,840 --> 03:46:10,480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: O nanggaling naman po sa mga foreigners outside of the Philippines?

3481
03:46:22,480 --> 03:46:24,980
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Madam Speaker, shinees colleague.

3482
03:46:25,240 --> 03:46:25,840
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Naka-lumped.

3483
03:46:25,840 --> 03:46:29,520
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Summum na po kasi yung data na yan sa BAUSI cases.

3484
03:46:31,100 --> 03:46:41,620
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: So, hindi po nila nabre-breakdown pa kung sino po yung nag-a-avail ng ganitong klaseng assistance with regard to child support in international cases.

3485
03:46:43,200 --> 03:46:53,920
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker, tayo po ay mag-initiate ng dialogo sa PAO at tungkol dito at sa mga relevant agencies natin, lalo na sa Central Authority natin dito, ang DSWD.

3486
03:46:53,920 --> 03:47:05,780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: So, para matiyak na ang mga konbensyon na kung saan tayo ay kasama, ay talagang natitiyak natin na nai-enforce, may maayos na implementasyon dito sa ating bansa.

3487
03:47:06,360 --> 03:47:11,940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At kung meron po kayong mga pinakahuling ulat tungkol dito, ay tatanggapin po ng ating representasyon.

3488
03:47:12,800 --> 03:47:19,300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ngayon naman, Madam Speaker, pinakahuli ko po na ilalapit at ihahapag sa Department of Justice

3489
03:47:19,300 --> 03:47:23,900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: tungkol po sa nakalaan na 90 million pesos.

3490
03:47:23,920 --> 03:47:31,580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: 90 million pesos noong 2024 para sa agricultural camp for children in conflict with the law.

3491
03:47:33,000 --> 03:47:43,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maari po ba natin malaman mula sa Bucor kung ano na po ang status ng sinasagawa na ito o tinatayo na ito na the agri-camp

3492
03:47:43,860 --> 03:47:47,520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa ayon sa ating Juvenile Justice and Welfare Act.

3493
03:47:53,920 --> 03:48:17,900
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: So, ongoing po sa ngayon ang agricultural camp.

3494
03:48:18,100 --> 03:48:23,800
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Ito turn over pa lang po sa Bucor ang kampong ito kapag natapos na.

3495
03:48:23,920 --> 03:48:33,600
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Pero ang main agency po na humahawak po sa pag-implement po nito ay DSWD, funding from the DPWH po.

3496
03:48:35,300 --> 03:48:42,420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: During the DSWD budget briefing, Madam Speaker, this representation has also manifested its misgivings

3497
03:48:42,420 --> 03:48:52,600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: on the construction of an agri-camp within the Iwahit penal farm as it may create stigma and bias against the CICLs

3498
03:48:52,600 --> 03:48:59,540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: who, under the juvenile justice system, should be rehabilitated, not put in prison.

3499
03:48:59,920 --> 03:49:05,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Narilis ko po itong concern na ito kasi pinaliwanag din po sa akin ng DSWD na malaki yung lupa, malaki po yung area.

3500
03:49:06,360 --> 03:49:13,980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Pero yung mismo pong pagkakadikit noong facility for children doon sa pangalan mismo ng Iwahit,

3501
03:49:14,180 --> 03:49:20,720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: baari na pong mag-create talaga ng stigma at mag-sponsor ng bias against them.

3502
03:49:20,720 --> 03:49:21,720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: No, kaya po.

3503
03:49:21,980 --> 03:49:22,560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sana.

3504
03:49:22,600 --> 03:49:26,900
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kaya po ma-address ng DOJ at ng BUCOR ang concern na ito.

3505
03:49:27,260 --> 03:49:34,640
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ang pakipag-upuan, nakausap na rin po namin ang Council for the Welfare of Children at ang JJWC tungkol sa concern na ito

3506
03:49:34,640 --> 03:49:37,800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na kung paano po natin isa sa ayos.

3507
03:49:38,160 --> 03:49:43,440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Hindi lang yung concern tungkol sa bias, pero yung concern din tungkol sa visitation ng family,

3508
03:49:44,100 --> 03:49:49,780
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ng kanilang mga kakilala, na kung nag-iisa lang po yan at napakalayo, hindi po magiging ganun kadali.

3509
03:49:49,780 --> 03:49:51,420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: No, para yung mga bata.

3510
03:49:51,420 --> 03:49:58,980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ay tuloy-tuloy po yung kanilang support system mula naman sa labas ng camp, ng agri-camp na ito.

3511
03:49:59,240 --> 03:50:09,240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At nananawagan din po tayo sa kapulungan na ito na agaran ng tignan yung mga naiulat sa atin na gaps sa implementation ng JJWA.

3512
03:50:09,940 --> 03:50:20,420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil malinaw po na marami pang hindi napapatupad ng mga probisyon, bukod dyan marami pang pondo na kinakailangan para matiyak na yung mga mahalagang programa for rehabilitation,

3513
03:50:20,420 --> 03:50:24,100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay nabibigyan ng sapat na pondo.

3514
03:50:24,420 --> 03:50:27,760
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At bilang pang huli, mag-i-request din po ang aming representation.

3515
03:50:28,120 --> 03:50:36,480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sana makapag-arrange po muli ang kongreso kasama ang mga child rights advocates ng ocular inspection sa facility.

3516
03:50:36,940 --> 03:50:42,220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At matiyak po natin na magiging tunay na child-friendly ang facility na ito.

3517
03:50:42,520 --> 03:50:46,180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At tunay na facility para po sa hustisya.

3518
03:50:46,180 --> 03:50:48,240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming maraming salamat Madam Speaker.

3519
03:50:48,540 --> 03:50:50,220
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat sa Distinguished Sponsor.

3520
03:50:50,420 --> 03:50:51,340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa DOJ Bucor.

3521
03:50:51,860 --> 03:50:54,460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Sa PAO at sa lahat po ang mga kasama natin ngayong araw.

3522
03:50:55,100 --> 03:50:56,060
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Thank you Madam Speaker.

3523
03:50:56,260 --> 03:50:57,440
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Thank you Distinguished Colleague.

3524
03:50:57,620 --> 03:50:58,680
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Welcome na welcome daw po.

3525
03:50:59,020 --> 03:50:59,940
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Sabi po ng Bucor.

3526
03:51:01,120 --> 03:51:03,820
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Thank you Representative Elago, Majority Leader.

