03:52:44,100 --> 03:52:48,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: My questions, first of all, have to do with confidential funds.

3546
03:52:49,100 --> 03:52:55,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The documents of the Department of Justice and the attached agencies.

3547
03:52:55,100 --> 03:53:04,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So I have a graphic, kung pwede pong ipakita.

3548
03:53:04,100 --> 03:53:06,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ayan.

3549
03:53:06,100 --> 03:53:14,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, dun po mas sa itaas.

3550
03:53:14,100 --> 03:53:28,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: For, at ang pinakamataas po na appropriation for confidential funds ng Department of Justice

3551
03:53:28,100 --> 03:53:34,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: was 1.91 billion pesos in 2025.

3552
03:53:35,100 --> 03:53:36,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: For,

3553
03:53:36,100 --> 03:53:46,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: for,

3554
03:53:46,100 --> 03:53:57,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: a 10-year period from 2016 to 2027, and that is shown in the bar chart, bar,

3555
03:53:57,100 --> 03:54:01,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yeah, the bar chart on the screen,

3556
03:54:01,100 --> 03:54:06,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: a total of 4.93 billion has been appropriated

3557
03:54:06,100 --> 03:54:12,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: for the DOJ, DOJ-wide,

3558
03:54:12,100 --> 03:54:17,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and that includes the proposed for 2027.

3559
03:54:17,100 --> 03:54:19,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Alright.

3560
03:54:19,100 --> 03:54:27,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Well, ito po yung mas siguro, mas madaling maintindihan yung visualization.

3561
03:54:27,100 --> 03:54:34,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, binalikan po natin, the past 10 years, yung mga appropriations,

3562
03:54:34,100 --> 03:54:37,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: o, blue is NEP.

3563
03:54:37,100 --> 03:54:45,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Um, orange is enacted in the GAA and the green obligated.

3564
03:54:46,100 --> 03:54:47,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung actual.

3565
03:54:47,100 --> 03:54:50,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: O, yung actual na natanggap at ginastos.

3566
03:54:51,100 --> 03:54:52,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No.

3567
03:54:52,100 --> 03:54:54,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And, uh, for the most part,

3568
03:54:54,100 --> 03:54:55,880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung inkilin

3569
03:54:55,880 --> 03:54:57,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and the actual, uh,

3570
03:54:58,100 --> 03:55:00,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ah, very close to each other.

3571
03:55:00,100 --> 03:55:03,100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: May, there was only one instance where

3572
