Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: that is the year 2022, you can see 2022, where the actual exceeded the appropriations.

3573
03:55:16,220 --> 03:55:23,540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ibig sabihin, mas nadagdagan pa, possibly ibig sabihin nun na augment, augment from savings.

3574
03:55:23,540 --> 03:55:38,060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. But what is notable in this presentation is that in 2016, the level of appropriations for confidential funds was 259 million.

3575
03:55:40,280 --> 03:55:46,060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And there was some growth throughout the years, pero hindi ganun kalaki.

3576
03:55:46,060 --> 03:55:53,380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. We do notice, however, that starting with this administration, the Marcos Jr. administration,

3577
03:55:53,540 --> 03:56:05,580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ay naging significant na po ang paglaki ng confidential funds para sa Department of Justice across all agencies.

3578
03:56:07,360 --> 03:56:17,120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Nakita po natin, in 2023, the proposed confidential funds was 383 million.

3579
03:56:17,120 --> 03:56:23,120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: However, it was Congress that made instructions.

3580
03:56:23,540 --> 03:56:26,580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: An institutional amendment to increase it.

3581
03:56:27,580 --> 03:56:37,900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kaya practically doble ang inilaki, naging 722 million, of which 700 million was actually used.

3582
03:56:40,120 --> 03:56:47,280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Then, so ang unang nagpalaki po ay ang administrasyon ito, and it was through Congress.

3583
03:56:48,240 --> 03:56:52,900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And then, in particular, in 2025, we see a...

3584
03:56:53,540 --> 03:57:03,040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: dramatic, a huge rise in the level of confidential funds for the Department of Justice, 2025 po ito.

3585
03:57:03,040 --> 03:57:09,280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The proposed was 579 million in the NEP.

3586
03:57:10,120 --> 03:57:17,560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung pinasan ng Kongreso sa GAA, 1.91 billion times 4. Times 4. Ang laki.

3587
03:57:18,620 --> 03:57:21,960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At halos lahat yun, mukha, ay ginastos.

3588
03:57:21,960 --> 03:57:22,920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

3589
03:57:23,540 --> 03:57:29,380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And then, we see the same pattern, although hindi kasing laki, nung 2026.

3590
03:57:29,500 --> 03:57:31,060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ito, the current fiscal year.

3591
03:57:31,700 --> 03:57:37,700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang proposed 579, ang in-approve ng Kongreso, doble.

3592
03:57:38,800 --> 03:57:41,560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Almost doble, 1.07 billion.

3593
03:57:42,560 --> 03:57:51,760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And now, the proposed for 2027 is 579 million again, same level as this year.

3594
03:57:53,540 --> 03:57:59,820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Well, ang tanong ngayon sa Kongreso, following recent patterns, dodoblehin na naman po ba yan?

3595
03:58:00,700 --> 03:58:00,860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

3596
03:58:02,220 --> 03:58:03,420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Baka pwedeng tanong natin.

3597
03:58:03,640 --> 03:58:08,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Well, ngayon, sasabihin, Kongreso ang gumawa niyan, Kongreso.

3598
03:58:09,080 --> 03:58:17,660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero alam naman natin, yung Kongreso ay umaakto batay sa request ng agency.

3599
03:58:17,660 --> 03:58:19,960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Di ba, ganun ang patakaran ng BARC.

3600
03:58:20,820 --> 03:58:23,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Para ma-increase ito, it has to be.

3601
03:58:23,400 --> 03:58:24,840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: It has to be an institutional amendment.

3602
03:58:25,160 --> 03:58:33,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And the Congress, the BARC only acts on official requests coming from the agency itself.

3603
03:58:33,280 --> 03:58:40,320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, in other words, yung nangyari nung, pwede natin sabihin, nangyari nung 2025, 2026,

3604
03:58:41,280 --> 03:58:47,720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ay humingi ng dagdag ang department sa mga ito.

3605
03:58:47,720 --> 03:58:53,360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ang tanong ko po, meron na naman po ba ang request for additional?

3606
03:58:53,400 --> 03:58:59,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Confidential funds ang DOJ for 2027?

3607
03:59:01,120 --> 03:59:07,480
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Madam Speaker, it is initially meron po, to keep it at the same level lang po as of that 2026 level.

3608
