4158
04:41:19,520 --> 04:41:24,020
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: I rise today to present for the consideration of this august chamber,

4159
04:41:24,060 --> 04:41:33,980
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: the proposed 5 billion budgetary support for the Philippine Reclamation Authority for Fiscal Year 2027.

4160
04:41:34,840 --> 04:41:43,840
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Intended for the continued implementation of the Philippine International Exhibition Center, PIEC.

4161
04:41:44,940 --> 04:41:52,660
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: PRA is the government instrumentality mandated not only to regulate and undertake reclamation,

4162
04:41:52,920 --> 04:41:53,820
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: but

4163
04:41:53,820 --> 04:41:54,380
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: also

4164
04:41:54,380 --> 04:41:55,140
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: to

4165
04:41:55,140 --> 04:41:55,540
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: pursue

4166
04:41:55,540 --> 04:42:04,360
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: infrastructure development and the development and management of public estate in the national interest.

4167
04:42:05,720 --> 04:42:15,860
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: In furtherance of this mandate, the PIEC is envisioned as a national flagship infrastructure project

4168
04:42:15,860 --> 04:42:23,040
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: that will strengthen the country's capacity to host major international meetings,

4169
04:42:23,040 --> 04:42:30,480
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: conventions, and exhibitions, support tourism, and related industries,

4170
04:42:31,280 --> 04:42:38,360
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: and enhance the productive use and value of government-owned properties in the area.

4171
04:42:38,980 --> 04:42:45,200
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: With this, Madam Speaker, I am ready for the interpellation and in advance,

4172
