Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: I thank our distinguished colleagues for their consideration and support

4173
04:42:51,740 --> 04:42:52,700
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: for the

4174
04:42:53,040 --> 04:42:57,020
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: proposed budget of the Philippine Reclamation Authority.

4175
04:42:57,240 --> 04:42:57,980
Rep. Josefina B. Tallado: Maraming salamat po.

4176
