Rep. Arnan C. Panaligan: the period of interpolation of the proposed budget of the Department of Migrant Workers.

6436
07:24:42,500 --> 07:24:49,780
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: There is a joint motion from the majority and the minority to terminate the sponsorship debate and interpolation

6437
07:24:50,460 --> 07:24:55,540
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: of the proposed budget of the Department of Migrant Workers, including its attached agencies.

6438
07:24:55,820 --> 07:24:56,840
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Do we hear an objection?

6439
07:24:57,740 --> 07:24:59,560
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Hearing none, said motion is approved.

6440
07:25:01,240 --> 07:25:07,080
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: The period of sponsorship debate and interpolation of the proposed budget of the Department of Migrant Workers,

6441
07:25:07,280 --> 07:25:10,360
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: including its attached agencies, is hereby terminated.

6442
07:25:11,620 --> 07:25:12,460
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Majority Leader.

6443
07:25:13,040 --> 07:25:15,200
Rep. Ryan S. Recto: Madam Speaker, I move to suspend session for a few minutes.

6444
07:25:15,200 --> 07:25:15,940
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Session suspended.

6445
07:30:33,440 --> 07:30:34,540
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Session resumed.

6446
07:30:36,160 --> 07:30:37,000
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Majority Leader.

6447
