6449
07:30:56,260 --> 07:31:18,980
Rep. Ryan S. Recto: Before we proceed, Madam Speaker, may we acknowledge the heads and officials of the department. They are the following: Secretary Dante Francis M. Ang II, Chief Administrative Officer Ms. Tiffany Jones V. Uriate, Mr. Romeo M. Rosas II, Ariel T. Cruz, Mr. Jans Jerome Bentula, Madam Speaker.

6450
