Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: to sponsor the proposed

6458
07:31:48,180 --> 07:31:50,360
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: budget of the Commission on Filipinos Overseas.

6459
07:31:51,240 --> 07:31:51,960
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Madam Speaker,

6460
07:31:52,200 --> 07:31:53,880
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Distinguished Members of the House of

6461
07:31:53,880 --> 07:31:56,040
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Representatives, it is my privilege

6462
07:31:56,040 --> 07:31:57,780
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: to sponsor the proposed budget

6463
07:31:57,780 --> 07:31:59,440
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: of the Commission on Filipino

6464
07:31:59,440 --> 07:32:01,340
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Overseas for

6465
07:32:01,340 --> 07:32:03,140
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: Fiscal Year 2027

6466
07:32:03,140 --> 07:32:04,340
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: for the total

6467
07:32:04,340 --> 07:32:06,780
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: spending of

6468
07:32:06,780 --> 07:32:09,200
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: for the total budget of

6469
07:32:09,200 --> 07:32:13,080
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: 195,200,000 pesos.

6470
07:32:13,780 --> 07:32:14,900
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: This representation

6471
07:32:14,900 --> 07:32:16,880
Rep. Irene G. Labadlabad: is now ready for interpolation.

6472
07:32:20,140 --> 07:32:21,280
Rep. Ryan S. Recto: Madam Speaker,

6473
07:32:21,940 --> 07:32:23,340
Rep. Ryan S. Recto: I move to recognize the Honorable

6474
07:32:23,340 --> 07:32:24,140
Rep. Ryan S. Recto: Presley De Jesus.

6475
