Rep. Rodolfo "Ompong" M. Ordanes: Social safeguards po.

7259
08:29:18,660 --> 08:29:20,380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Social safeguards.

7260
08:29:21,040 --> 08:29:22,700
