Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: separation and processing within their respective domestic regulatory systems consistent with applicable law.

7297
08:32:16,400 --> 08:32:21,780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kasi isa yun sa mga probisyon nung Memorandum of Understanding.

7298
